hadiths[49]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3701","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The one who drinks wine is like an idol-worshipper, and the one who drinks wine is like a worshipper of al-Lat and al-Uzza."""
"3702","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""May these faces be disfigured!"""
"3703","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""(Bring) your two witnesses, or (accept) his oath."""
"3704","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst people of my Ummah are those who talk excessively, speak affectedly and speak pompously to show off, and the best people of my Ummah are those with the best character."""
"3705","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst people of my Ummah are those who were raised in luxury, who eat all kinds of food, wear all kinds of clothes and speak affectedly."""
"3706","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst food is the food of a wedding feast (walimah) from which those who would come are kept away and to which those who would not come are invited. And whoever does not accept an invitation has disobeyed Allah and His Messenger."""
"3707","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst earnings are the fee of a prostitute, the price of a dog and the earnings of a cupper."""
"3708","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst person is the one who is asked in the name of Allah and still does not give."""
"3709","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The worst thing in a man is excessive miserliness and a cowardice that leaves him disheartened."""
"3710","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The honour of the believer lies in his prayer at night, and his dignity lies in being independent of what is in the hands of people."""
"3711","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Sha'ban, between Rajab and Ramadan, is a month about which people are heedless. In it the deeds of the servants are raised (to Allah), so I love that my deed is raised while I am fasting."""
"3712","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""There are two things that my Ummah will not abandon: wailing over the dead and slandering lineages."""
"3713","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The cure for sciatica (pain of the hip) is that the tail fat of a Bedouin sheep be melted, then divided into three portions, then one portion be drunk each day on an empty stomach."""
"3714","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""My intercession is for those of my Ummah who commit major sins."""
"3715","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Respond to your brother (when he sneezes) three times; if it is more than that, then it is merely a cold or catarrh."""
"3716","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The witnesses of Allah on earth are His trustees over His creation, whether they are killed or die a natural death."""
"3717","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""As a boy, I witnessed with my paternal uncles the Hilf al-Mutayyabin (the pact of those who perfumed themselves), and I would not like to have red camels (the finest wealth) in exchange for breaking it."""
"3718","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The month of patience (Ramadan) and three days of every month, this is equal to fasting perpetually."""
"3719","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Two months are never deficient, the two months of Eid: Ramadan and Dhu al-Hijjah."""
"3720","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Surah Hud and surahs like it have made me old (have turned my hair white)."""
"3721","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Surah Hud and surahs like it turned my hair white before old age."""
"3722","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Surah Hud and surahs like it from the Mufassal have turned my hair white."""
"3723","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Surah Hud, al-Waqi'ah, al-Mursalat, 'Amma yatasa'alun and Idha ash-shamsu kuwwirat have turned my hair white."""
"3724","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""A devil following a she-devil (meaning a pigeon)."""
"3725","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The goat is one of the animals of Paradise."""
"3726","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Al-Sham is the land of the Gathering and of the Resurrection (being raised up)."""
"3727","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Ill omen is in three things: in a woman, in a dwelling and in a riding animal."""
"3728","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The one who is present sees what the one who is absent does not see."""
"3729","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Hidden shirk is that a man does a deed because of another man (his presence or his status)."""
"3730","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Shirk in my Ummah is more hidden than the creeping of an ant on a rock."""
"3731","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Shirk among you is more hidden than the creeping of an ant. I will tell you of something which, if you do it, will remove from you both minor and major shirk: say, 'O Allah, I seek refuge in You from knowingly associating partners with You, and I seek Your forgiveness for what I do not know.' Say this three times."""
"3732","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The neighbour (partner) has more right to his adjoining land, whatever it may be."""
"3733","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Poetry is like speech: its good part is like good speech and its bad part is like bad speech."""
"3734","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Healing is in three things: a drink of honey, the incision of cupping and cauterisation with fire, but I forbid my Ummah from cauterisation."""
"3735","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Pre-emption (shuf'ah) applies to everything jointly owned, whether land, a house or an orchard. It is not right for a partner to sell (his share) until he offers it to his partner, who may then take it or leave it. And if he sold it without informing him, his partner has more right to it until he is informed."""
"3736","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Pre-emption applies where boundaries have not yet been fixed; once the boundaries are fixed, there is no pre-emption."""
"3737","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The sun and the moon will be rolled up on the Day of Resurrection."""
"3738","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Black seed (nigella) is a remedy for every disease except death."""
"3739","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Martyrdom (apart from being killed in the path of Allah) is of seven kinds: the one killed in the path of Allah is a martyr, the one who dies of plague is a martyr, the one who drowns is a martyr, the one who dies of pleurisy (dhat al-janb) is a martyr, the one who dies of a stomach disease is a martyr, the one who burns to death is a martyr, the one who is crushed under a collapsing building is a martyr, and the woman who dies in childbirth is a martyr."""
"3740","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Those martyrs who fight in the path of Allah in the front row and do not turn their faces away (from the battlefield) until they are killed, they are placed in the lofty upper chambers of Paradise. Your Lord smiles at them, and when Allah Almighty smiles at His believing servant, there is no reckoning for him."""
"3741","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The martyrs are five: the one who dies of plague, the one who dies of a stomach disease, the one who drowns, the one crushed under a collapsing building, and the one martyred in the path of Allah."""
"3742","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The martyrs are on the bank of a river, 'Bariq', at the gate of Paradise, in a green dome. Their provision comes out to them from Paradise morning and evening."""
"3743","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The month is (also) twenty-nine days, so do not fast without seeing the moon, and do not stop fasting (without seeing the moon). And if (the moon) is hidden from you, then complete thirty days."""
"3744","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The month is sometimes twenty-nine days and sometimes thirty days. So when you see it (the moon), fast, and when you see it, stop fasting. And if it is hidden from you, then complete the count."""
"3745","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The martyr feels no more pain from being killed than one of you feels from being pinched."""
"3746","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The martyr feels no more pain from being killed than one of you feels from being pinched."""
"3747","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The martyr will intercede for seventy of the people of his household."""
"3748","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""White hair is the light of the believer. No man has a single hair turn white in Islam except that, for every white hair, he receives a good deed and is raised by one rank because of it."""
"3749","The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""The old man's body grows weak, but his heart remains young in the love of two things: the desire for a long life and the love of wealth."""
